                                                "text": "\"The guy that just left—what's he got in his lungs?\" / \"Well, I'm not very sure. But the two best candidates are uranium-233 and plutonium-239, one or both.\" / \"They're in his bones too, aren't they?\" / \"Yeah, they're both boneseekers. And they've got half-lives of one hundred sixty-two thousand and twenty-four thousand years respectively. So they stay hot for a long time.\""
